\r\n  \r\n  <a name=\"m_8623160078769017923_m_-7327050886509147799_group_thread_0\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a>\r\n  <div style=\"display:inline-block;font-family:arial;padding:4px 0 5px 0px\">\r\n  \r\n    <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/t/5cb446ef7589346?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" style=\"font-size:21px;color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/t/5cb446ef7589346?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367551328000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32UX_IGrURWYFbeJiGZwz8\">\r\n      How to rotate the label like  geom_text(angle=45)\r\n    </a>\r\n  \r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        cqzan &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">chuanq...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Nov 23 07:13AM -0800\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      &lt;<a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x30hL-rp5pE/WDWwSDhL9rI/AAAAAAAAABE/8xj3w9xefSwAwhyBZcPZzkmQIVps8DO1QCLcB/s1600/label.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x30hL-rp5pE/WDWwSDhL9rI/AAAAAAAAABE/8xj3w9xefSwAwhyBZcPZzkmQIVps8DO1QCLcB/s1600/label.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367551328000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2zQ_GUHlX8VMCV3zRl4Xz8\">https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x30hL-rp5pE/WDWwSDhL9rI/AAAAAAAAABE/8xj3w9xefSwAwhyBZcPZzkmQIVps8DO1QCLcB/s1600/label.png</a>&gt;<br>\r\nthanyou .<br>\r\n\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/msg/6d32264278eca?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/msg/6d32264278eca?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367551328000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1PJN-5yeV3XNTMTEgae6uI\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        Xingmin Zhang &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kingma...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Nov 23 10:18AM -0800\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      Do a ?geom_text in your console to read the manual. <br>\r\n <br>\r\nIt&#39;s like this:<br>\r\n <br>\r\ndf &lt;- data.frame(<br>\r\n  x = factor(c(1, 1, 2, 2)),<br>\r\n  y = c(1, 3, 2, 1),<br>\r\n  grp = c(&quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;, &quot;a&quot;, &quot;b&quot;)<br>\r\n)<br>\r\n <br>\r\n\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/msg/6dd455c6f0c61?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/msg/6dd455c6f0c61?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367551328000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1n2aYQTdgAW3Dd-HE2k-NW\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n    <tr><td style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#2e2e2e;font-family:arial;padding:10px 15px;border:1px solid #d3d3d3\">\r\n      <span style=\"color:#b1b0b0;font-size:15px\">\r\n        cqzan &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">chuanq...@gmail.com</a>&gt;: Nov 24 04:03AM -0800\r\n      </span>\r\n      <br><br>\r\n      谢谢，我是想问把图中有背景颜色的也变为45度的怎么弄，p &lt;- ggplot(mtcars, aes(wt, mpg, label = <br>\r\nrownames(mtcars)))<br>\r\np\r\n      \r\n        <span style=\"font-size:11px\"><a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/msg/717585b0bf102?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2/msg/717585b0bf102?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367551328000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Ym8QmhI5iHAE5rbtl9-Zn\">...more</a></span>\r\n        <br>\r\n      \r\n    </td></tr>\r\n    \r\n  </table>\r\n  <div style=\"font-size:11px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:5px\">\r\n    <a style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" href=\"#m_8623160078769017923_m_-7327050886509147799_digest_top\" rel=\"nofollow\">Back to top</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div style=\"background-color:#f5f5f5;padding:5px 20px\">\r\n  <table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"width:100%\">\r\n  <tbody><tr>\r\n    <td style=\"padding-top:4px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;color:#636363;font-size:11px\">\r\n      \r\n      You received this digest because you&#39;re subscribed to updates for this group. You can change your settings on the <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source=digest&amp;utm_medium=email#!forum/ggplot2/join\" style=\"color:#1155cc;text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/?utm_source%3Ddigest%26utm_medium%3Demail%23!forum/ggplot2/join&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792367551328000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2edURM5Cc5a6t2E438GqAN\">group membership page</a>.<br>\r\n      To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r\n    </td>\r\n  </tr></tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
